# Kids music player

Single-binary Go **web server** (`net/http`, no Gin/Echo/Chi unless asked). Listens on **21983**. UI is Alpine.js + Tailwind, embedded with `go:embed`. No Node build in the runtime.

Music directory is a CLI flag (required). Never serve files outside that directory.

Playback is HTML5 in the browser. One shared player for all tabs. mp3 only. Folders as albums. Auth is a session cookie once an account exists; an empty accounts database stays open. Sleep timer stops music only. Random play is on by default and skips tracks already in history until history is cleared.

Read `.cursor/skills/kids-music-player/SKILL.md` before implementing.
